  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The various solid wastes in the form of slags and sludges that are emerged from steel plants are blast furnace slag.&nbsp;Fly ash is a fine by-product recovered from gases of burning coal in thermal power plants.&nbsp;Gypsum is the waste of fertiliser industry. Non-cellulosic part of plant is wastes of paper industry and it is biodegradable.</p></blockquote>"
